command-description-implant-give =
    Give the piped entity the specified implant prototype if they don't already have it.
command-description-implant-remove =
    Remove the specified implant prototype from the piped entity if they have it.
command-description-implant-with =
    Filter the piped list of entities by whether they have the specified implant.
command-description-implant-has =
    Returns true or false depending on if the piped entity has the specified implant.
